      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE SKITTLES (4) has been out of the placings last two but shapes well for this if she can recapture her slick win a few runs back, getting around this track over 400m in 22.39. Rates on top and can find winning form again. SWEET MICHELLE (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 22.64 beating Mr Flame. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. One of the key runners again. NERA CARNEY (7) has a strong record here with four wins and a minor from eight starts. Was out of placings last time (30.92) at Cannington in a Grade 5, finishing eighth and beaten 17 lengths. Can feature in the finish. WEST ON TAPPER (6) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish at a big quote.",
